    "Magnific": "Create a premium image-generation prompt for Magnific. Objective: {category} / {theme}. Build the image around one dominant hero subject or object. Character placement: {composition}. Dimensions: {dimensions}. Color palette: {color palette}. Use the shared Description of references for visual language only. Specify subject placement, scale, background, lighting, materials, textures, depth, atmosphere, supporting elements, and negative constraints. Keep the composition clean, premium, and generation-ready.",
    "Figma AI": "Create a concise, precise image-generation prompt for Figma AI. Create a {category} / {theme} visual. Character placement: {composition}. Dimensions: {dimensions}. Color palette: {color palette}. Use Description of references only for shared visual characteristics; do not copy artwork or unique objects. Include subject, placement, lighting, materials, background, depth, and what to avoid. Prioritize a clear focal point and readable composition.",
    "ChatGPT / Codex": "# FINAL IMAGE GENERATION PROMPT\n## 1. Objective Summary\nCreate a premium {format} for {category/campaign}, built around a single hero object or subject: {hero subject}. The image should feel premium and polished.\n\n## 2. Creative References\nUse the shared Description of references for inspiration only. Do not copy layouts, artwork, exact text, logos, or unique subjects.\n\n## 3. Core Style Rules\nTheme: {theme}\nColor palette: {color palette}\n\n## 4. Composition Specification\nCharacter placement: {composition}\nDimensions: {dimensions}\nDefine hero placement, scale, background, lighting, materials, atmosphere, supporting elements, and visual hierarchy.\n\n## 5. Negative Prompt\nAvoid clutter, multiple focal points, flat lighting, poor spacing, inconsistent reflections, low-quality materials, irrelevant decorative elements, and unwanted cropping."
  },
